      "category": "Text",
      "text": "(a) Promoting the role of New York City as the headquarters of the United Nations; and for this and related purposes, maintaining close liaison with the United Nations Secretariat and the individual delegates and United Nations personnel, subject to the policy guidance of the appropriate officials in the United States Mission to the United Nations, but subject finally to the instructions of the Mayor.",
